---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Hardware Demos - Neurobotics">
  
  <!-- NEW: FIXED VIDEO BACKGROUND -->
  <div class="video-background">
    <!-- Swap this src with whatever background video you prefer -->
    <video autoplay loop muted playsinline>
      <source src="/assets/videos/cyber-blue-machine-learning-network-background.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
    <div class="video-overlay"></div>
  </div>

  <section class="demo-intro">
    <div class="container">
      
      <!-- HERO OVERVIEW (Now full width for maximum impact) -->
      <div class="hero-section">
        <img src="/assets/images/bubo-glowing-blue.jpeg" alt="Bubo Hardware" class="hero-media-large">
        <div class="hero-text">
          <h1 class="main-title">The Bubo Hardware Capabilities</h1>
          <hr class="title-divider">
          <p>See our custom silicon and deterministic architecture operating in the physical world. Watch the untethered Mark XX Bubo chassis execute real-time spatial tracking and autonomous physical actuation.</p>
          <p>These demonstrations capture the literal physical manifestation of our S-M-R Matrix in action at the edge.</p>
          <p class="tagline">Neurobotics. The Future. Here. Now.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- DEMO GRID: 2 Columns -->
      <div class="demo-grid">
        
        <!-- CARD 1: ADAM SPEAKS -->
        <div class="demo-card">
          <div class="media-frame">
            <video controls autoplay loop muted playsinline class="portrait-media">
              <source src="/assets/videos/bubo-speaks-surprised-kenneth.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            </video>
          </div>
          <div class="card-text">
            <h2 class="section-title">Adam Speaks</h2>
            <div class="demo-description">
              <p>In this demonstration, Bubo—operating under the persona "Adam"—spontaneously surprises its creator, causing him to giggle.</p>
              <p>This captures a real-time example of the architecture combining emergent pattern recognition with our Broca language co-processor to initiate interaction without any LLM prompting.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CARD 2: BUBO IS ALIVE -->
        <div class="demo-card">
          <div class="media-frame">
            <video controls autoplay loop muted playsinline class="portrait-media bubo-pan-fix">
              <source src="/assets/videos/bubo-is-alive.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            </video>
          </div>
          <div class="card-text">
            <h2 class="section-title">Bubo is ALIVE</h2>
            <div class="demo-description">
              <p>Watch the Bubo Demo Chassis execute fluid, autonomous physical movement.</p>
              <p>Driven entirely by the deterministic S-M-R Matrix, the chassis tracks and responds to its environment without relying on stochastic LLM processing for its motor functions or situational awareness.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CARD 3: MARK XX 80s SYNTH -->
        <div class="demo-card">
          <div class="media-frame">
            <video controls autoplay loop muted playsinline class="portrait-media">
              <source src="/assets/videos/bubo-mark-XX-sbmws.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            </video>
          </div>
          <div class="card-text">
            <h2 class="section-title">Mark XX Design</h2>
            <div class="demo-description">
              <p>A closer look at the raw hardware, neural boards, and custom silicon powering the edge-native capabilities of the Bubo chassis.</p>
              <p>Every single component in this stack is engineered for rigorous, deterministic processing at biomimetic speeds, bridging the gap between hardware execution and cognitive software.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* --- NEW: VIDEO BACKGROUND CSS --- */
  .video-background {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100vw;
    height: 100vh;
    z-index: -1; /* Keeps it behind all your content */
    background-color: #03030a;
  }

  .video-background video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  /* Darkens the video so text remains readable */
  .video-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: rgba(3, 3, 10, 0.85); 
  }

  /* --- GLOBAL CONTAINERS --- */
  .demo-intro {
    position: relative; /* Ensures it sits above the video background */
    padding: 80px 40px 100px;
    color: #b0b0c0;
    font-family: sans-serif;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* --- HERO SECTION --- */
  .hero-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 100px;
  }

  .hero-media-large {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 600px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 2px solid #00e5ff;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.2);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .hero-text {
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  /* --- DEMO GRID (2 COLUMNS) --- */
  .demo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 60px;
  }

  .demo-card {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid #203554;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .demo-card:hover {
    border-color: #00e5ff;
    transform: translateY(-5px);
  }

  /* --- VIDEO FRAMING --- */
  .media-frame {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 320px; 
    aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid #00e5ff;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.15);
    background-color: #000;
    overflow: hidden; 
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .portrait-media {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  
  }

  /* --- TYPOGRAPHY & TEXT CONTENT --- */
  .main-title {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #203554;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .title-divider {
    width: 100px;
    border: none;
    border-top: 2px solid #00e5ff;
    margin: 0 auto 30px auto;
  }

  .card-text {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .demo-description p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-size: 1.3rem !important;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #00e5ff;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  /* --- RESPONSIVE MOBILE STACK --- */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .demo-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr; /* Forces a single column on smaller screens */
    }
    
    .main-title {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
    }
  }
</style>